 CellID->749612539],

Cell["\<\
WWW Graph of Computational Geometry for Link Analysis Ranking Experiments: \
The Base Set is constructed by including all out-links of each page in the \
Root Set. We use the refined algorithm for detecting intra-domain links.\
\>", "Notes"]
}, Open  ]],

